+     * rival holds Chikorita's, Cyndaquil's, Totodile's line: with UPR's starters (Cyndaquil, Totodile,
+     * Chikorita) and "us i => them i+1", the tags are RIVALn-1, -2, -0. Lyra holds the same lines and
